WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.818
This paper, presented at ICML 2024, introduces the
Distance Aware Bottleneck,

00:00:04.898 --> 00:00:10.352
a new way to give deep neural networks the sense of
"knowing what they don't know." The

00:00:10.432 --> 00:00:16.141
authors reframe uncertainty quantification as a
rate-distortion problem: the network learns

00:00:16.221 --> 00:00:19.512
a compact codebook that summarizes its training data,

00:00:19.592 --> 00:00:25.237
and the distance of a new input from that codebook
becomes a principled uncertainty score,

00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:27.400
computed in a single forward pass.
